{"1":{"ar":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"The Striking Calamity -","tj":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ <span class=end>١</span>","pg":600},"2":{"ar":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"What is the Striking Calamity?","tj":"مَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَارِعَةُ <span class=end>٢</span>","pg":600},"3":{"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","tj":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>كَ مَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَارِعَةُ <span class=end>٣</span>","pg":600},"4":{"ar":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","tj":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسُ كَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْفَرَاشِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ث<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>ثِ <span class=end>٤</span>","pg":600},"5":{"ar":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","tj":"وَتَكُونُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجِبَالُ كَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعِهْنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>شِ <span class=end>٥</span>","pg":600},"6":{"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","tj":"فَأَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا مَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ث</tajweed>َقُلَتْ مَو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>زِينُهُۥ <span class=end>٦</span>","pg":600},"7":{"ar":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","en":"He will be in a pleasant life.","tj":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةٍ ر</tajweed>َّاضِيَةٍ <span class=end>٧</span>","pg":600},"8":{"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","en":"But as for one whose scales are light,","tj":"وَأَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>زِينُهُۥ <span class=end>٨</span>","pg":600},"9":{"ar":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","en":"His refuge will be an abyss.","tj":"فَأُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>ُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> هَاوِيَةٌ <span class=end>٩</span>","pg":600},"10":{"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","en":"And what can make you know what that is?","tj":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>كَ مَا هِيَهْ <span class=end>١٠</span>","pg":600},"11":{"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","tj":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةُۢ <span class=end>١١</span>","pg":600}}